---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy information for the UK Church Software Directory, including current analytics, form and structured-data practices."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Privacy" }]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: 25 July 2026.</p>

      <h2>Current foundation build</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy analytics are disabled and no form endpoint is connected. The
        static forms cannot currently submit information. The site does not
        intentionally set analytics or advertising cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
      <p>
        A future hosting provider may process routine request information such as
        IP addresses, browser details and timestamps for security and service
        operation. Production hosting has not yet been configured.
      </p>

      <h2>Future form submissions</h2>
      <p>
        Before forms are enabled, this notice must be updated with the responsible
        organisation, contact details, purposes, lawful basis, processors,
        retention and rights information. Do not send sensitive church-member
        information through a correction or suggestion form.
      </p>

      <h2>Public software data</h2>
      <p>
        The structured export contains publishable product information and public
        supplier-source URLs. It does not contain private editorial notes or user
        submissions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
